{"data":"<div class=\"w-100 ck-content\">\n        <p><strong>4. \u305d\u308c\u3067<\/strong><\/p><figure class=\"table\" style=\"width:43.81%;\"><table class=\"ck-table-resized\"><colgroup><col style=\"width:100%;\"><\/colgroup><tbody><tr><td style=\"vertical-align:top;\"><ul style=\"list-style-type:disc;\"><li><p>\u30d0\u30b9\u304c\u6765\u307e\u305b\u3093\u3002<strong><u>\u305d\u308c\u3067<\/u><\/strong>\u3001\u3042\u308b\u304d\u307e\u3057\u305f\u3002<\/p><p>Xe bu\u00fdt kh\u00f4ng \u0111\u1ebfn. V\u00ec th\u1ebf t\u00f4i \u0111\u00e3 \u0111i b\u1ed9.)&nbsp;<\/p><\/li><li><p>\u96e8\u304c\u3075\u3063\u3066\u3044\u307e\u3059\u3002<strong><u>\u305d\u308c\u3067<\/u><\/strong>\u3001\u5bb6\u306b\u3044\u307e\u3059\u3002<\/p><p>(Tr\u1eddi \u0111ang m\u01b0a. V\u00ec th\u1ebf t\u00f4i s\u1ebd \u1edf nh\u00e0.)<\/p><\/li><\/ul><\/td><\/tr><\/tbody><\/table><\/figure><p><u>a. S\u1eed d\u1ee5ng:&nbsp;<\/u><\/p><p>V\u00ec th\u1ebf. T\u1eeb nguy\u00ean nh\u00e2n, l\u00fd do d\u1eabn \u0111\u1ebfn m\u1ed9t vi\u1ec7c x\u1ea3y ra trong th\u1ef1c t\u1ebf.<\/p><p><u>b. C\u1ea5u tr\u00fac:\u3000<\/u><\/p><figure class=\"table\" style=\"width:16.23%;\"><table class=\"ck-table-resized\"><colgroup><col style=\"width:100%;\"><\/colgroup><tbody><tr><td style=\"background-color:hsl(0, 0%, 90%);\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">&nbsp;<strong>A\u305d\u308c\u3067B<\/strong><\/p><\/td><\/tr><\/tbody><\/table><\/figure><p>&nbsp;<\/p><p>&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span class=\"text-big\"><strong>&nbsp; Unit 14\u30fb\u8a9e\u5f59\u30ea\u30b9\u30c8\uff0811\u500b\uff09<\/strong><\/span><\/p><figure class=\"table\" style=\"width:69.78%;\"><table class=\"ck-table-resized\"><colgroup><col style=\"width:33.38%;\"><col style=\"width:29.11%;\"><col style=\"width:37.51%;\"><\/colgroup><tbody><tr><td style=\"background-color:hsl(0, 0%, 90%);border:0.5pt solid #000000;padding:0pt 5.4pt;text-align:center;\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>\u3053\u3068\u3070<\/strong><\/p><\/td><td sty